WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.358 --> 00:00:04.705
- Hello, Believe Nation, it's Evan,

00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:06.242
and, as you know, probably by now,

00:00:06.242 --> 00:00:08.741
I've written a book called Your One Word.

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:10.280
It's all about helpin' you find

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.926
the one core value that you have

00:00:11.926 --> 00:00:14.547
and then bring it to your
life and to your business

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:16.658
so you can create something that has

00:00:16.658 --> 00:00:19.217
much more meaning, more intension,

00:00:19.217 --> 00:00:21.935
more value and more awesomeness.

00:00:21.935 --> 00:00:23.632
And so, I finally created a new series

00:00:23.632 --> 00:00:26.514
to try to share some of the one words

00:00:26.514 --> 00:00:29.082
of successful entrepreneurs
that we look up to.

00:00:29.082 --> 00:00:31.255
The first video in this
series was on Oprah Winfrey.

00:00:31.255 --> 00:00:32.748
Her one word was love,

00:00:32.748 --> 00:00:37.062
and I want to continue the
series today with will.i.am.

00:00:37.062 --> 00:00:40.320
- If you had to think of one word

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.213
that's most important to
you or that sums you up

00:00:42.213 --> 00:00:45.073
or that would be kind
of like a little beacon.

00:00:45.073 --> 00:00:45.906
- Will.

00:00:47.523 --> 00:00:49.266
Not in the egotistical way, either.

00:00:49.266 --> 00:00:51.150
Just the will.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.654
And not the thing you
write before you die.

00:00:53.654 --> 00:00:56.821
The will, to have will, determination,

00:00:59.187 --> 00:01:01.854
to have strength, courage, will.

00:01:04.821 --> 00:01:05.747
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:01:05.747 --> 00:01:07.670
I'd love to know what did
you think of this clip?

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:10.843
Also I'm really curious to
know what is your one word?

00:01:10.843 --> 00:01:11.689
If you've figured it out,

00:01:11.689 --> 00:01:13.695
please leave it down
in the comments below.

00:01:13.695 --> 00:01:15.185
Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:01:15.185 --> 00:01:16.360
I believe in you.

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.275
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:01:18.275 --> 00:01:20.618
and whatever your one word is.

00:01:20.618 --> 00:01:23.451
Much love, guys, I'll see ya soon.

